flowchart TD
  A[Move action] --> B[Validate board and coordinate]
  B --> C{Valid input?}
  C -->|No| D[Return failure reason]
  C -->|Yes| E[Validate player and ownership]
  E --> F{Legal?}
  F -->|No| D
  F -->|Yes| G[Resolve bounded cascade]
  G --> H{Burst limit exceeded?}
  H -->|Yes| I[Return original board unchanged]
  H -->|No| J[Return settled result]
  D --> K[UI feedback]
  I --> K
  J --> L[Commit after presentation]
